<title>INDIA: WSC-India and Pakistan Wheat Weather, Sept 16.</title>
<headline>WSC-India and Pakistan Wheat Weather, Sept 16.</headline>
<text>
<p>SUMMARY- Mostly dry with highs 85-98F (29-37C).</p>
<p>CROP IMPACT- Planting for winter wheat begins in October.</p>
<p>FORECAST-</p>
<p>TODAY...Sunny to partly cloudy. Highs 84-97F (29-36C).</p>
<p>TONIGHT...Partly cloudy to mostly clear. Lows 68-76F (20-24C).</p>
<p>TOMORROW...Little change from today's weather expected.</p>
<p>OUTLOOK...Generally dry over most of the region, but isolated showers are possible in India Wednesday-Friday.</p>
<p>Source: Weather Services Corporation</p>
</text>
